  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A particle of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is moving along the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis with initial velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. It collides elastically with a particle of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> at rest and then moves with half its initial kinetic energy (see figure). If&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;then value of n is ________.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7c61b07c-69f4-4eee-b582-e6e31a4dbe48-image.png\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 132px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "From momentum conservation in perpendicular direction of initial motion.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>mv</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br />Given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mu</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />From equation (1) &amp; (2)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
